[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0250","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0250.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0289","title":"Phusion WebServer 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Phusion WebServer 1.0 在处理 HTTP 请求时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未对用户提交的 URL 字段进行充分的长度边界检查。远程攻击者可通过发送超长的 HTTP 请求 URL 字段，使服务器栈缓冲区溢出，从而造成拒绝服务或执行任意代码。由于 Phusion WebServer 在 Windows 系统上通常以 SYSTEM 权限运行，攻击者可借此获取目标主机的完全控制权。该漏洞影响 Phusion WebServer 1.0 版本，攻击无需身份认证，只需向目标 80 端口发送特制的超长 URL 请求即可触发。目前已有公开 PoC 可供验证。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0289"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:09Z","remediation":"将 Phusion WebServer 从 v1.0 升级至 v1.0.7 或更高版本，该版本修复了 URL 解析中的缓冲区溢出问题。升级后，在 Phusion WebServer 配置文件中添加 URL 长度限制指令（如设置 MaxUriLen 为 2048 字节），拒绝超出长度的 HTTP 请求。同时在 Windows 防火墙中配置入站规则，仅允许受信任的 IP 地址访问 Web 服务器默认端口（TCP 80），以降低被远程利用的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101408906001958&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4118","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4119","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21294","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2002/CVE-2002-0289.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/1f5f4a7529535611b31b809b0a8ef45f4f10599a/2002/CVE-2002-0289.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ee7574df80bfcc012868b69b66762b8e0d540545/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0289.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0289.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-0289.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3ed8c658b6417422ff741957485ec0a908b97173/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0289.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/8b65b3568fc850e3d8aa3f18e8c47ee5b8f5840f/2002/CVE-2002-0289/README.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2002/CVE-2002-0289.md","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/bfc6853442f54ace67bf90c1038789d200c35c7f/2002/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0289","https://github.com/alt3kx/CVE-2002-0289"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0250.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0250.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0250.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0246","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0246.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0288","title":"Phusion WebServer 1.0 目录遍历漏洞","description":"CVE-2002-0288是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0288"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:09Z","remediation":"由于 Phusion WebServer 1.0 厂商 BBShareware 未发布修复补丁且软件已停止维护，建议立即迁移至受支持的 Web 服务器（如 Apache、Nginx 或 IIS）并配置严格的目录访问权限。如短期内无法替换，请在防火墙或反向代理层拦截包含 .../ 及 HTTP 编码路径遍历字符的请求，同时以最低权限运行 Web 服务进程，并限制服务器可访问的文件系统范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101408906001958&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4117","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21291","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2002/CVE-2002-0288.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/1f5f4a7529535611b31b809b0a8ef45f4f10599a/2002/CVE-2002-0288.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b328bc09980ed1c829df312deb1700fa6b961e03/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0288.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0288.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-0288.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c3259b0cbf17b142c0e516420bc21bb303a8efff/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0288.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/9f6dead40269b937deb0fd43c7db6209e1c7deb1/2002/CVE-2002-0288/README.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2002/CVE-2002-0288.md","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/84fbcb1a7df1104f66c1a5d3cab353ea8f0e4391/2002/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0288","https://github.com/alt3kx/CVE-2002-0288"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0246.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0245","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0245.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0280","title":"CodeBlue SMTP 响应缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"CodeBlue 4 及更早版本（含 CodeBlue 5.1）的 SMTP 服务存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。程序在处理 SMTP 响应时未对输入字符串长度进行有效校验，攻击者可构造一段超长的 SMTP 响应字符串并发送至目标服务器，触发栈缓冲区溢出。该漏洞无需身份认证即可被远程利用，成功利用后可导致任意代码执行，影响范围为运行受影响版本的所有 SMTP 服务实例。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0280"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:08Z","remediation":"立即停止使用 CodeBlue 并卸载该软件。CodeBlue 已于 2002 年停止维护，官方未发布修复补丁。建议替换为现代 Web 日志分析工具（如 GoAccess 或 ELK Stack）。若短期内无法卸载，应以非 root 用户运行 CodeBlue，并在防火墙层面阻止其向外部 SMTP 服务器发起出站连接（仅允许访问内部 Apache 服务器），同时对访问日志中的 SMTP 响应进行输入长度过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://freshmeat.net/releases/71514/","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101392671306875&w=2","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21643","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2002/CVE-2002-0280.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6c59753dc6e5de3c597a526685e2e9874d6f653a/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0280.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/38158e6e901ddca3c8ee20ca9ec4743fea0a0aa4/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0280.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0280","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0280.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0280.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0280.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/358cc56c62f49a17f624c71ebd0e3263352acb81/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-02xx/CVE-2002-0280.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-0280.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6e362f6959b500f9e0530cd95885d05afaa93bae/2002/CVE-2002-0280.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0245.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0241","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0241.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0276","title":"Ettercap 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Ettercap 0.6.3.1 及更早版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，存在于多个解码器中。当在 MTU 大于 2000 的网络上运行时，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送大型数据包触发该漏洞，从而在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响使用 Ettercap 进行网络嗅探与中间人攻击的所有场景，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0276"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:07Z","remediation":"建议将 Ettercap 升级至 0.6.4 或更高版本（当前最新稳定版为 0.8.4.1），该版本已修复大 MTU 网络环境下解码器的缓冲区溢出问题。临时缓解措施：避免在 MTU 大于 2000 的网络接口（如 loopback、Token Ring、Hyperchannel）上运行 Ettercap，或在防火墙层面限制高 MTU 数据包进入运行 Ettercap 的主机。如无法立即升级，可将网络接口 MTU 强制修改为 1500 或更低以降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ettercap.sourceforge.net/index.php?s=history","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101370874219511&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8200.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4104","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21289","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d01cc3b51c3d46ca313e02b941d9469d580d931b/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0276.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0276.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0276","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0276.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0276.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2002/CVE-2002-0276.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/52ddd3fbe097d381a58d14aae3f8c42a9146b190/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-02xx/CVE-2002-0276.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/094d6382e9f2b76e665247588266e58be890fb67/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0276.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0276.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0276.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0241.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0175","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0175.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0274","title":"Exim 命令行参数缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"Exim 3.34 及更早版本在处理超长的 -C（配置文件）及其他命令行参数时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可向受影响系统提交特制的超长命令行参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取目标系统的权限提升。该漏洞影响 Exim 3.34 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。攻击者需具有本地访问权限方可利用此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0274"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-05-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:07Z","remediation":"升级 Exim 至 3.35 或更高版本。如无法升级，可应用 2xs 安全团队提供的补丁（将多处 strcpy 替换为 strncpy 并增加长度检查）。Red Hat 用户应安装 RHSA-2002:208 提供的更新包。作为临时缓解措施，限制本地用户对 Exim 二进制文件的执行权限（chmod 750 /usr/exim/bin/exim）并移除 suid 位（chmod u-s /usr/exim/bin/exim）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101362618118598&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8194.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-208.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4096","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0274.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0274.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0274","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0274.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0274.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/878a3042444029b151459a1565a690101509a27a/2002/CVE-2002-0274.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-02xx/CVE-2002-0274.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/57b318ad84d91f19df2f11e62567e45db1dd90ad/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0274.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0274.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0274.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0175.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0172","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0172.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0272","title":"mpg321 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"mpg321 是一款开源的 MP3 音频播放器，其 0.2.9 之前版本存在多处缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过向该程序提供超长的 URL 参数（包括命令行选项、HTTP 请求或 FTP 请求中的 URL）触发缓冲区溢出，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，影响范围广泛。目前厂商已发布新版本修复此漏洞，建议用户升级至 mpg321 0.2.9 或更高版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0272"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-05-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:07Z","remediation":"立即将 mpg321 升级至 0.2.9 或更高版本。该版本修复了通过命令行参数、HTTP 请求及 FTP 请求中长 URL 触发的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级，建议移除 mpg321 或限制其网络访问权限，避免向不可信来源传递超长 URL 参数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101366518310823&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=vuln-dev&m=101355590918475&w=2","http://sourceforge.net/project/shownotes.php?release_id=79237","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4091","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0272.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0272.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0272","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0272.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0272.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0ccbe74701d72e8d7117a09b2db369605fa0bae6/2002/CVE-2002-0272.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c8205feda508d733c873e4904e8ec7780820d9e3/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0272.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-02xx/CVE-2002-0272.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0272.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0272.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0172.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0286","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0286.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0375","title":"Ecometry Sgdynamo 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"Ecometry SGDynamo 5.32、6.1 及 7.0 版本的 sgdynamo.exe 模块存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该漏洞的原理是程序在处理 HTTP 请求时，未对 HTNAME 参数输入的内容进行严格的过滤与转义，导致远程攻击者可以通过构造包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的特定 URL，诱导目标用户访问并触发脚本执行。攻击者可借此在受害者的浏览器上下文中运行任意代码，从而导致敏感 Cookie 泄露、会话劫持或页面篡改。影响范围覆盖上述所有受影响版本，攻击条件为目标用户点击攻击者发送的恶意链接。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0375"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:18Z","remediation":"由于该产品版本过旧且厂商已停止维护，建议立即停止使用 Ecometry SGDynamo 5.32/6.1/7.0 版本。若必须继续运行，应在 Web 应用防火墙 (WAF) 或反向代理层配置过滤规则，拦截包含 `<script>` 标签或恶意 JavaScript 伪协议的 `HTNAME` 参数请求，以缓解跨站脚本攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102107488402057&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=vuln-dev&m=101908986415768&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/3458","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/9830","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21446","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/33ec434954e61bc39d0dce97d60b798545efd141/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0375.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/39cf4547de2e266ceb8827aa7ae993ba929a25b6/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0375.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0375","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0375.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0375.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2d3362e5d3b95223fab83ca531e4c3b2a7ca274a/2002/CVE-2002-0375.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/1b01d01b655cac08088621898fd70278524e2f0e/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-03xx/CVE-2002-0375.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/63bc6ccb7d9e7d0447e23eb842c0b23beddd261c/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0375.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0375.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0375.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0286.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0239","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0239.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0266","title":"Thunderstone TEXIS 路径泄露漏洞","description":"Thunderstone TEXIS 3.0 的 CGI 脚本存在全路径泄漏漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送对不存在文件或目录的 HTTP 请求触发该漏洞。当请求的资源不存在时，服务器返回的错误页面中会包含 Web 根目录的完整物理路径名，导致攻击者能够获取服务器文件系统的目录结构和敏感系统信息，为后续的定向攻击提供侦察数据。该漏洞影响 TEXIS 3.0 及更早版本，攻击者仅需构造一次简单的 HTTP 请求即可完成信息获取，无需凭据且攻击复杂度低。Thunderstone 已在后续版本 4.03.1049406926 中修复此问题，建议管理员升级至安全版本并加强 Web 应用错误信息配置，避免向客户端暴露内部路径信息。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0266"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:06Z","remediation":"升级 Thunderstone TEXIS 至 4.03.1049406926 或更高版本以修复路径泄露漏洞。若无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（如 Apache/Nginx）中配置自定义错误页面，屏蔽 CGI 脚本返回的错误信息中暴露的完整文件路径，同时通过访问控制规则限制对 /texis/ 目录的远程访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101301228031165&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101346478229431&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8103.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4035","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21276","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f38c5fdc2d5ae016cb5ff615cdaf3941dc98e9f4/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0266.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0266.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0266","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0266.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0266.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2002/CVE-2002-0266.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-02xx/CVE-2002-0266.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/094d6382e9f2b76e665247588266e58be890fb67/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0266.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0266.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0266.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0239.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0237","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0237.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0265","title":"Sawmill 6.2.x 管理员密码文件不安全默认权限漏洞","description":"Sawmill for Solaris 6.2.14及更早版本在创建AdminPassword文件时设置了全局可写权限，导致本地用户可通过修改该文件提升权限。该漏洞影响Sawmill for Solaris 6.2.14及更早版本，CVSS评分4.6（本地访问、低复杂度、无需认证、部分影响机密性/完整性/可用性）。攻击者需具备本地访问权限，通过修改全局可写的AdminPassword文件实现权限提升。Sawmill官方已发布更新版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0265"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:06Z","remediation":"建议升级至 Sawmill 6.2.15 或更高版本，或手动修复 AdminPassword 文件权限：执行 chmod 600 /path/to/Sawmill/AdminPassword 移除全局写权限，限制仅管理员可读写。若无法升级，请限制本地用户对 Sawmill 安装目录的写入权限作为临时缓解。建议尽快升级到最新版 Sawmill 以彻底修复该权限配置缺陷。升级包可从 Sawmill 官网下载（http://www.sawmill.net/）","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101346206921270&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8173.php","http://www.sawmill.net/version_history.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4077","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21288","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f38c5fdc2d5ae016cb5ff615cdaf3941dc98e9f4/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0265.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0265","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0265.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0265.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2002/CVE-2002-0265.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/094d6382e9f2b76e665247588266e58be890fb67/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0265.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0265.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0265.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-02xx/CVE-2002-0265.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0265.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0237.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0235","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0235.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0263","title":"EZNE.NET Ezboard 2000 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"EZNE.NET EasyBoard 2000 1.27 (即 EZboard) 存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过向 ezboard.cgi、ezman.cgi 或 ezadmin.cgi 发送包含超长 boundary 值的 multipart Content-Type 头触发缓冲区溢出，进而实现远程任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 EasyBoard 2000 1.27 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），影响机密性、完整性和可用性。攻击者通过构造畸形的 multipart 请求，在处理 boundary 参数时触发栈缓冲区溢出，劫持程序控制流执行任意代码。ExploitDB 已公开 PoC (EDB-21287)，攻击者可直接利用实现远程代码执行。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0263"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:06Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 EasyBoard 2000 1.28 及以上版本或迁移至现代论坛系统（如 Discuz!、phpBB）。若无法升级，请在 Web 服务器层面配置规则拦截 multipart Content-Type 中超长 boundary 值（限制长度 ≤ 256 字节），或在 Web 服务器配置中禁用/删除 ezboard.cgi、ezman.cgi、ezadmin.cgi 三个易受攻击的 CGI 脚本。同时建议在 WAF 层面添加规则拦截包含异常长 boundary 参数的 multipart 请求。若业务允许，建议彻底下线该组件并迁移至维护中的论坛系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101345069220199&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8162.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4068","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21287","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f38c5fdc2d5ae016cb5ff615cdaf3941dc98e9f4/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0263.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0263.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0263","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0263.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0263.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2002/CVE-2002-0263.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-02xx/CVE-2002-0263.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/094d6382e9f2b76e665247588266e58be890fb67/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0263.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0263.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0263.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0235.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0234","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0234.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0256","title":"Arescom NetDSL 1000 Telnet 服务远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Arescom NetDSL 1000 路由器 Telnet 服务存在远程拒绝服务漏洞，攻击者可通过向 Telnet 端口发送包含超长字符串的连接请求序列，导致大量登录失败并耗尽服务资源，最终导致 Telnet 服务停止响应。该漏洞影响 Arescom NetDSL 1000 路由器，CVSS 评分 5.0（中等危害），攻击向量为网络远程、攻击复杂度低、无需身份认证，仅影响可用性（可用性影响：部分）。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程发起攻击，通过发送大量包含超长字符串的 Telnet 连接请求触发漏洞，导致设备 Telnet 服务停止响应，造成拒绝服务。ExploitDB 已公开 PoC 代码（EDB-ID: 1464），攻击者可利用该 PoC 直接发起攻击。Arescom 官方已停止对此设备提供支持，建议用户升级固件或更换设备，或通过防火墙限制 Telnet 端口访问。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0256"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:05Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 AcomNetDSL-1000 路由器固件至支持安全补丁的版本（如 V1.2.3 及以上），或通过官方升级工具进行手动升级。如无法立即升级，可通过路由.admin 禁用 Telnet 服务或在防火墙规则中限制 Telnet 端口 23 的访问频次作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101328827420630&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8123.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4067","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/1464","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f38c5fdc2d5ae016cb5ff615cdaf3941dc98e9f4/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0256.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0256.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0256","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0256.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0256.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2002/CVE-2002-0256.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-02xx/CVE-2002-0256.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/094d6382e9f2b76e665247588266e58be890fb67/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0256.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0256.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0256.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0234.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0233","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0233.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0252","title":"Apple QuickTime Content-Type 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Apple QuickTime Player 5.01 和 5.02 版本在处理 HTTP 响应中的 Content-Type MIME 头时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可构造包含超长 Content-Type 头的恶意 HTTP 响应，诱导用户使用易受攻击的 QuickTime Player 访问恶意网站或媒体流，触发缓冲区溢出实现远程任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Windows 和 Mac OS X 平台上的 QuickTime Player 5.01/5.02 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），属于高危漏洞。攻击者需诱导受害者访问恶意构造的 Web 页面或媒体流，无需用户交互即可触发漏洞，成功利用可导致任意代码执行，完全控制受害系统。Apple 已发布 QuickTime 6.0 修复该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0252"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:04Z","remediation":"立即完全卸载已弃用的QuickTime播放器，并使用现代浏览器（如Chrome、Edge或Firefox）播放网页视频。如果必须保留QuickTime，可找到官方安全更新版本（如QuickTime 7.6.8），并确保定期更新到最新支持版本，以彻底修复2002年CVE-2002-0252缓冲区溢漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101320742616105&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8126.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4064","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/4673","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21286","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2002/CVE-2002-0252.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f54d76ab772484c9516adea70c89afaeb5255051/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0252.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0252.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-0252.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0252.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0252","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0252.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0252.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0252.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-0252.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0233.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0231","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0231.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0250","title":"HP AdvanceStack 交换机身份认证绕过漏洞","description":"HP AdvanceStack 交换机中的 Web 配置工具存在身份认证绕过漏洞。该漏洞影响 J3200A 至 J3210A 型号的交换机，尤其是运行固件版本 A.03.07 及更早版本的设备。攻击者无需任何身份验证，只需发送一个直接的 HTTP 请求到 web_access.html 文件即可绕过身份认证机制，从而完全控制交换机的配置，包括修改管理员密码和执行其他配置变更。此漏洞的攻击复杂度低，攻击面广，可通过网络远程利用，可能导致对交换机配置的完全未经授权的修改，危及网络设备的安全性和稳定性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0250"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:04Z","remediation":"升级 HP AdvanceStack 交换机固件到支持安全补丁的最新版本，移除 web_access.html 文件并重新设计认证机制，为管理界面启用强密码策略和多因素认证，通过防火墙限制对管理端口的访问，并定期检查系统日志以检测异常认证尝试。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101318469216213&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/3870","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8124.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4062","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21285","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f54d76ab772484c9516adea70c89afaeb5255051/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0250.json","https://github.co