Caldera UnixWare 7.1.1 的安全补丁版本，参考 Caldera 安全公告 CSSA-2002-SCO.3（ftp://stage.caldera.com/pub/security/unixware/CSSA-2002-SCO.3/CSSA-2002-SCO.3.txt）获取并安装对应补丁。临时缓解措施：在运行 setuid 程序（如 vxprint）前，将 LC_MESSAGES 环境变量设置为空值或不可信的只读目录，阻止攻击者通过该变量注入恶意格式字符串载荷。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/255414","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8113.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4060","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21284","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fc5c3e6f60accc24b7eac4fd31472f0e5fd97f24/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0246.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0246.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0246","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0246.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0246.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2002/CVE-2002-0246.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7f8cb0f5372a51b89f819e1c3a9d694706e18788/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0246.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-02xx/CVE-2002-0246.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0246.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0246.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0230.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0228","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0228.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0244","title":"AtheOS AtheOS 0.3.7 目录遍历漏洞","description":"AtheOS 0.3.7 操作系统的 chroot 函数存在目录遍历漏洞，攻击者可通过向 chdir 函数传递包含 \"..\" (点点) 的路径名参数逃逸 chroot 监狱环境。该漏洞影响 AtheOS 0.3.7 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5 (AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P)，属于高危漏洞。攻击条件为网络可达、低攻击复杂度、无需身份认证，攻击者可远程利用该漏洞突破 chroot 限制访问文件系统任意目录，导致机密性、完整性和可用性部分受损。ExploitDB (EDB-21282) 及多个 GitHub 仓库已公开 PoC 利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0244"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:04Z","remediation":"AtheOS 0.3.7 已停止维护且无官方补丁，根本解决方案是迁移至受支持的操作系统（如 Linux LTS 或 FreeBSD）。临时缓解措施：1) 在网络边界部署防火墙限制对该主机的访问，仅允许必要管理 IP；2) 禁用非必要网络服务，降低攻击面；3) 避免依赖 chroot 进行安全隔离，改用完整虚拟机或容器技术；4) 若必须继续使用，确保 chroot 目录无 \"..\" 遍历路径，进程以非 root 权限运行，并删除 chroot 内不必要的 setuid 程序；5) 审计所有 chdir 调用，禁止非受信用户访问 chroot 环境。建议在 7 天内完成网络隔离，30 天内完成系统迁移。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101310622531303&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4051","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/8108","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21282","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2002/CVE-2002-0244.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fc5c3e6f60accc24b7eac4fd31472f0e5fd97f24/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0244.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0244.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-0244.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0244.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0244","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0244.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0244.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44a